OL,3,AUkraine and Russia say emergency alert
OL,4,Aapps hit by cyber-attacks as false
OL,5,Awarnings issued
OL,6,
OL,7,FHours later, Russia itself said a
OL,8,F"massive cyber-attack" had affected its
OL,9,Fapp, with the emergencies ministry
OL,10,Fsaying people were receiving emails
OL,11,Fcontaining fake information
OL,13,FMoscow is yet to say who it believes is
OL,14,Fbehind the cyber-attack on its system -
OL,15,Fit's not clear if the two incidents are
OL,16,Fconnected
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
